<title>SRI LANKA: CTC Eagle Insurance first half net falls.</title>
<headline>CTC Eagle Insurance first half net falls.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results for the six months ended June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  H1 1996	     H1 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover		  570.20    vs	490.41</p>
<p>    Net profit		 24.25    vs	 25.13</p>
<p>    Tax provision	     6.11    vs	  4.21</p>
<p>NOTE - CTC Eagle Insurance Co Ltd is a unit of Ceylon Tobacco Co Ltd, which is a subsidiary of BAT Industries Plc. A company official attributed the profit fall to a competitive general insurance market and sluggish share market.</p>
</text>
